<title>INDIA: India Tata Honeywell 96/97 net up 30 pct.</title>
<headline>India Tata Honeywell 96/97 net up 30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    38.7     vs    29.8</p>
<p>    Sales and other  1,672.3     vs 1,613.8</p>
<p>income</p>
<p>    Operating profit   175.4     vs   125.1</p>
<p>    Interest costs	79.2     vs    74.9</p>
<p>    Depreciation	  15.1     vs    12.0</p>
<p>    Tax		     10.4     vs     5.2</p>
<p>    Gross profit	  96.2     vs    50.2</p>
<p>Note: Tata Honeywell Ltd, part of the Tata Group, specialises in office and factory automation products.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
